  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investing in Noncommunicable Disease prevention and control in Pacific Island Countries 2023-2029</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity will invest over six years in five areas to make an impact on the 75% NCD mortality rate&#xA0;in the Pacific region. The focus areas for this investment are:
- a suite of activities relating to tobacco control
- treatment of NCDs and their risk factors in primary care health facilities
- data collection on NCDs and their risk factors
- capability building for NCD policy development; and
- capability building for NCD monitoring and evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
